-- reading --
at 0 is <, at 2 is >, at 99 is ''
has 8 true, has 9 false
starts at 0 with <a> true
span 3..5 is 'hi'
span past the end is 'a>'
find </ from 0 is 5, find <z> is -1
-- release bounds it --
read 2000 characters, window never above 9
without release the window holds 2000 of 2000
-- lines --
line at 0 is 1, at 5 is 2, at 10 is 3
after releasing past two newlines, line at 10 is still 3
-- a failure is not an end --
read 2 characters, then: the stream closed: the peer hung up
a clean end reports: nothing
